{"reviewId": "426466585_85w1QbulB", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "在长波衰退和萧条期，结构性机会通常出现在：\n1、技术创新： 能极大地提高生产效率，打破存量僵局的新技术（如AI、新能源）。\n2、必需消费与服务： 无论经济多差，人都要吃饭看病。\n3、并购重组： 行业老大吃掉老二老三，通过提高市场集中度来维持利润。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "未来的机会更多地存在于结构变动而不是总量的变化中，这是一个投资逻辑的改变。按照我们对当前资本市场的认识，至少在可以预见的一两年内，市场对机会的认识和把握都不可能是前10年的重复，而是一个颠覆。", "range": "1827-1923", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "426466585_85w1QbulB", "userVid": 426466585, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766148213, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426466585, "name": "Tiger", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/FGjGDOKWm7yMicbGRaQCpaNj1jwiatLAjJP0g29AbP0ZEhGDquyjBXH0FZy6IibiaCpjkrAbsJPtfqoSPklEwQaaVA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Tiger", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "裸泳AI", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241209-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 33, "likes": [{"userVid": 372598518, "name": "秩序与自由", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-Wqx5oMZGhrOONCJLoYFOofc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "秩序与自由", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "投资龙头企业，消费服务企业，科技兴国！", "revie